# Persian and RTL

User-visible copy belongs in i18next. Do not write Persian or English strings directly in JSX.

The default is `fa` and `dir="rtl"`, as set in `src/app/layout.tsx`. When the language changes, update `lang` and `dir` too.

Add a new key to both `src/shared/i18n/locales/fa.ts` and `en.ts`.

```tsx
// Bad
<button>Add to cart</button>

// Good
<button>{t("cart.add")}</button>
```
